  "prefLabel": "Env-A 104.22 Off-permit change",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 104.22 “Off-permit change” means a change that is not addressed or prohibited by a title V operating permit.\n\nSource. #6057-A, eff 6-30-95; ss and renumbered by #8256, eff 1-14-05 (from Env-A 101.195), (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading); renumbered by #8304 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading); renumbered by #9839 (from Env-A 101.133), (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading); ss by #13105, eff 9-25-20 (formerly Env-A 101.135) (see Revision Note #4 at chapter heading for Env-A 100)",
